<title>USA: Muzak Ltd/Muzak Capital Corp sets $100 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Muzak Ltd/Muzak Capital Corp sets $100 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Friday, said lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER MUZAK LTD PARTNERSHIP/MUZAK CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.00 PCT  MATURITY 10/01/07</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE 04/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BA3     SPREAD N.A.	 PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    YIELD 10.00 PCT   CALLABLE AFTER FOUR YEARS</p>
